            "name": "Is the Delhi service an authorised Toshiba repair centre?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "No. GR Solution is an independent business. For a television covered by a manufacturer plan, contact the warranty provider before arranging paid third-party work."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Does a Toshiba that has sound need a replacement screen?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Not necessarily. On an LED-based model, illumination can fail while the video image still exists. Display electronics and the panel must also be considered before deciding which part is responsible."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Can an older Toshiba model still be repaired?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Age alone does not decide it. The technician needs to identify the fault and check whether a compatible component is obtainable at a sensible price. A healthy panel makes board-level work more promising."
            }
          }
