      "Identify the Toshiba before choosing a repair",
      "A Toshiba badge does not identify the operating system or the display assembly. Look for the complete product code on the rear label or in the settings menu; a purchase invoice can help when the television is difficult to reach. Photograph the label without pulling a wall-mounted screen forward. The code lets the technician check compatibility rather than arriving with a board chosen only by screen size.",
