      "Plan the Delhi visit around access, not just the postcode",
      "Requests can cover Mayur Vihar, Laxmi Nagar, Preet Vihar, Dwarka, Rohini and other Delhi areas, subject to appointment availability. A nearby East Delhi address and a cross-city location need different travel planning. Include the floor, lift size and parking instructions when booking, especially for a large set above a market or in a builder floor.",
